## 📋 Key Files Explained

### Root Level
- **CMakeLists.txt**: Main build configuration
- **build.sh**: Quick build script
- **DRX_ENGINE_WHITEPAPER.md**: Complete technical spec
- **QUICKSTART.md**: Getting started guide

### Engine/
Core C++17 engine code organized by system

### AI/
Python-based AI system for code generation and learning

### Editor/
Qt-based visual editor application

### Examples/
Sample games and templates demonstrating engine features

## 🔧 Build Artifacts

After building, you'll find:

```
build/
├── bin/              # Executables
│   ├── DRXEditor
│   └── DRXRuntime
├── lib/              # Libraries
│   └── libDRXEngine.so
└── CMakeCache.txt    # CMake cache
```

## 📦 Third-Party Dependencies

All managed via CMake:
- Vulkan SDK (graphics)
- GLFW (windowing)
- GLM (math)
- Assimp (asset loading)
- Bullet Physics
- OpenAL Soft (audio)
- ImGui (UI)
- EnTT (ECS)
- pybind11 (Python bindings)

